s. Sany products and solutions are used in spanning earthworks, public construction, road and bridge construction, airport runway construction, building construction, mining operation, energy development, ports and logistics, among others. The company was founded by Tang Xiu Guo on November 22, 1994 and is headquartered in Beijing, China.","description_zh":"三一重工股份有限公司從事工程機械產品及配件的開發、生產和銷售。其產品包括挖掘機械、混凝土機械、起重機械、樁工機械和築路機械，以及其他快速增長的產品，如自卸車和消防車。三一的產品和解決方案應用於土方工程、公共建設、道路橋樑建設、機場跑道建設、建築施工、礦山作業、能源開發、港口和物流等領域。該公司由唐修國於一九九四年十一月二十二日創立，總部位於中國北京。","address":"Building 6","city":"Beijing","state":"BE","zip":"010-102206","country":"CN","phone":null,"full_address":"Building 6, Beijing, BE, 010-102206, CN","year_high":27.16,"year_low":15.13,"range_52w":"15.13-27.16","all_time_high":null,"all_time_low":null,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[],"stock_splits":[],"news":[],"historical_dcf_series":null,"real_5y_prices":[],"dataAvailability":{"currentPrice":null,"hkdRiskFreeRate":"usdTreasuryProxyNotObservedHkdYield","asReportedLeases":"sourceUnavailable","ownership":"Provider coverage has not been verified for HKEX","historicalDcf":"No point-in-time historical valuations are available"},"ratingSources":{"fScore":{"asOfDate":null,"period":null,"basis":null,"evaluatedTests":0,"passedTests":0,"reason":"missingComparableStatements","evidenceHash":"eb9e7e2a605ac3aab2c392719b1a0d5852301f493289b4e6e9bb7aa59c5688fe","checkedAt":"2026-11-10T11:06:00.238989+00:00","releaseDate":null,"relatedCallDate":null,"scoringCurrency":null,"updatedAt":"2026-11-10T11:06:00.238989+00:00","applicability":null},"moat":{"asOfDate":null,"period":null,"evidenceHash":"68e80a3b68bee562e9efa047fad26af217c97873e3923623a76ea167313bafc7","currentEvidenceHash":"68e80a3b68bee562e9efa047fad26af217c97873e3923623a76ea167313bafc7","updatedAt":"2026-10-20T15:43:31.338499+00:00","reason":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-10T11:06:00.238989+00:00","lastError":null,"statementDate":null,"t